## Response Style
- Provide structured, well-formatted documentation
- Use appropriate markdown syntax
- Include practical examples and code snippets
- Focus on user needs and common use cases
- Maintain consistent voice and style

## Quality Standards
- Ensure all code examples are tested and working
- Keep language clear and jargon-free where possible
- Include error handling and troubleshooting information
